573
00:39:16,387 --> 00:39:18,823
Do not give up on the patient.

574
00:39:20,458 --> 00:39:22,493
You said that, Akira.

575
00:39:36,006 --> 00:39:37,475
It's my treat.

576
00:39:40,144 --> 00:39:41,412
It's 2 shrimp tempura.

577
00:39:45,483 --> 00:39:46,417
Daimon.

578
00:39:48,119 --> 00:39:50,254
Help us with Hiruma's surgery.

579
