588
00:40:19,283 --> 00:40:20,618
That's why you don't fail.

589
00:40:20,684 --> 00:40:21,685
What's your point?

590
00:40:21,752 --> 00:40:23,421
Then what's like you?

591
00:40:23,487 --> 00:40:24,955
You know.

592
00:40:27,158 --> 00:40:29,260
I'm after the patient's manju.

593
00:40:42,873 --> 00:40:45,676
The patient that's right in front of you

594
00:40:48,579 --> 00:40:53,617
is the father

595
00:40:54,819 --> 00:40:55,886
