601
00:41:11,535 --> 00:41:12,837
Please.

602
00:41:13,237 --> 00:41:16,407
However, there's one more daughter.

603
00:41:17,508 --> 00:41:20,678
A daughter named Michiko Daimon.

604
00:41:20,744 --> 00:41:22,746
That's not right.

605
00:41:23,180 --> 00:41:25,749
Actually, just call my daughter.
Michiko Daimon.

606
00:41:25,816 --> 00:41:29,019
Please call her. Get her here.

607
00:41:29,086 --> 00:41:32,857
