611
00:41:37,761 --> 00:41:40,364
Dr. Ebina, let's begin.

612
00:41:41,599 --> 00:41:43,434
Dr. Eldest Son. Let's go.

613
00:41:55,846 --> 00:41:57,081
Vitals stable.

614
00:41:57,147 --> 00:41:58,582
