adverse effects after surgery.

625
00:42:53,470 --> 00:42:56,540
This is inoperable...

626
00:43:05,683 --> 00:43:07,651
After all this?

627
00:43:07,718 --> 00:43:11,922
But to add pancreatoduodenectomy here

628
00:43:12,756 --> 00:43:14,792
- is too risky.
- That's enough.

629
00:43:15,492 --> 00:43:16,927
This is crucial.

630
00:43:21,231 --> 00:43:22,066
Oh?

631
00:43:23,033 --> 00:43:26,236
It's infiltrated
the inferior vena cava too.

632
00:43:26,303 --> 00:43:28,939
