649
00:44:29,700 --> 00:44:30,701
Monopolar.

650
00:44:31,502 --> 00:44:32,603
Give it.

651
00:44:50,954 --> 00:44:52,589
Partial duodenectomy complete.

652
00:44:52,656 --> 00:44:54,224
