659
00:45:23,954 --> 00:45:25,956
Sir, it's time for your meeting.

660
00:45:42,706 --> 00:45:45,142
Hemicolectomy and duodenectomy done.

661
00:45:45,209 --> 00:45:46,143
Vitals?

662
00:45:46,210 --> 00:45:48,278
Blood pressure 100, pulse 60.

663
00:45:48,345 --> 00:45:51,315
Now, inferior verna cava removal.

664
00:45:51,381 --> 00:45:52,349
- Get the graft.
- Yes.

665
00:45:53,350 --> 00:45:55,085
- Hemostat.
- Yes.

666
00:45:56,186 --> 00:45:58,355
- So fast.
- Dissecting inferior verna cava.

667
00:45:58,422 --> 00:45:59,456
- Scalpel.
- Yes.

668
00:46:08,332 --> 00:46:09,433
Superhuman...

669
00:46:15,906 --> 00:46:19,510
SURGERY TIME

670
00:46:20,244 --> 00:46:21,411
