769
00:52:47,964 --> 00:52:49,032
Mr. Kanbara?

770
00:52:50,233 --> 00:52:51,168
I'll get the doctor.

771
00:52:51,234 --> 00:52:52,602
- Monitor too.
- Yes.

772
00:52:53,236 --> 00:52:55,505
Mr. Kanbara, can you hear me?

773
00:53:00,944 --> 00:53:01,811
Where's Daimon?

774
00:53:02,913 --> 00:53:04,414
What should we do?

775
00:53:04,881 --> 00:53:06,016
Get her.

776
00:53:08,818 --> 00:53:09,986
Contact Dr. Daimon.

777
00:53:10,053 --> 00:53:10,954
Yes.

778
00:53:13,657 --> 00:53:18,461
To develop medical technology
that will save millions worldwide...

779
00:53:18,528 --> 00:53:22,699
