on the one person I love.

807
00:54:55,025 --> 00:54:55,992
Dr. Daimon,

808
00:54:56,559 --> 00:54:57,627
please sign it.

809
00:54:57,694 --> 00:54:59,195
I won't do that.

810
00:55:17,314 --> 00:55:18,214
