- Yes.

819
00:55:40,470 --> 00:55:42,405
Give him antihypertensive and steroids.

820
00:55:43,073 --> 00:55:44,107
Hurry.

821
00:55:46,843 --> 00:55:48,244
There's anisocoria.

822
00:55:48,311 --> 00:55:49,479
Mannitol at full.

823
00:55:49,913 --> 00:55:51,581
OK, right frontotemporal craniotomy.

824
00:55:51,648 --> 00:55:52,482
Understood.

825
00:55:53,983 --> 00:55:55,385
- Get the ultrasound scalpel.
- Yes.

826
00:56:06,329 --> 00:56:07,731
Everything's ready.

827
00:56:07,797 --> 00:56:08,665
Thanks.

828
00:56:10,734 --> 00:56:12,736
OPERATION ROOM

829
00:56:15,839 --> 00:56:18,174
Daimon, you can do it.

830
00:56:20,076 --> 00:56:21,945
You got Mr. Tendo's permission?

831
00:56:23,546 --> 00:56:24,481
No.

832
00:56:25,515 --> 00:56:26,783
What?

833
00:56:27,350 --> 00:56:29,552
Forget the President.

834
00:56:30,987 --> 00:56:34,724
If worst comes to worst, he can fire me.

835
00:56:51,841 --> 00:56:54,711
I'll do my best, Akira.

836
00:57:06,689 --> 00:57:09,159
I will remove
the metastasized brain tumor.

837
00:57:09,225 --> 00:57:10,160
- Scalpel.
- Yes.

838
00:57:13,496 --> 00:57:15,231
METASTASIZED BRAIN TUMOR

839
00:57:16,332 --> 00:57:17,434
- Bipolar.
- Yes

840
00:57:18,067 --> 00:57:19,402
As you know,

841
00:57:19,469 --> 00:57:23,273
the national budget
for this is 200 billion yen.

842
00:57:23,339 --> 00:57:25,241
JAPAN MEDICAL INDUSTRY ASSOCIATION

843
00:57:26,209 --> 00:57:29,946
In accordance with
the government's strategy,

844
00:57:30,413 --> 00:57:32,182
the budget will be divided

845
00:57:32,248 --> 00:57:35,819
among projects under my control.

846
00:57:36,319 --> 00:57:41,391
I, the chairman,
will make all the decisions.

847
00:57:43,927 --> 00:57:46,196
I agreed to this organization

848
00:57:46,930 --> 00:57:52,001
since our interests
were supposed to match.

849
00:57:52,068 --> 00:57:53,503
I didn't agree to a monopoly.

850
00:57:54,404 --> 00:57:57,207
We have already debated this.

851
00:57:57,273 --> 00:57:59,809
There wasn't enough debate.

852
00:58:01,945 --> 00:58:03,680
I'm sorry.

853
00:58:04,781 --> 00:58:07,083
You are amateurs regarding healthcare.

854
00:58:07,951 --> 00:58:12,522
I am saying that there is
no room for politics there.

855
00:58:13,823 --> 00:58:18,695
Fighting over rights and interests
ruins the purpose of this.

856
00:58:18,761 --> 00:58:22,465
You do not understand this at all.

857
00:58:30,073 --> 00:58:32,108
I'll go up to the cerebral ventricle.

858
00:58:33,676 --> 00:58:34,677
A little more.

859
00:58:36,112 --> 00:58:37,714
Blood pressure at 70.

860
00:58:38,047 --> 00:58:39,782
Saturation won't go up.

861
00:58:39,849 --> 00:58:41,751
His breathing is bad.

862
00:58:41,818 --> 00:58:43,019
Check for hemorrhage.

863
00:58:43,520 --> 00:58:44,988
Wait 15 minutes.

864
00:58:45,054 --> 00:58:46,322
We can't.

865
00:58:46,389 --> 00:58:48,358
- Transfusion?
- Too much already.

866
00:58:48,424 --> 00:58:51,327
Gosh... I'll close the dura mater.

867
00:58:51,394 --> 00:58:54,898
- Where is the hemorrhage?
- I'd say aortic arch.

868
00:58:54,964 --> 00:58:56,766
So a thoracotomy?

869
00:58:56,833 --> 00:58:59,469
- Yes. Median sternotomy.
- Yes.

870
00:58:59,536 --> 00:59:02,138
Hurry. Blood pressure at 60.

871
00:59:02,205 --> 00:59:05,241
Okay. Damn. I'm so close.

872
00:59:05,975 --> 00:59:07,243
- 4-0-sutures.
- Yes.

873
00:59:18,755 --> 00:59:19,822
Mr. Tendo.

874
00:59:21,658 --> 00:59:24,327
It's not good to rush to conclusions.

875
00:59:24,394 --> 00:59:28,698
This is already written
in the bill that's been passed.

876
00:59:34,804 --> 00:59:36,005
Chief Cabinet Secretary!

877
00:59:38,641 --> 00:59:40,143
Sorry I'm late.

878
00:59:40,643 --> 00:59:45,114
It seems the debate is heating up.

879
00:59:45,782 --> 00:59:50,820
Mr. Tendo won't discuss
about the budget anymore.

880
00:59:51,788 --> 00:59:55,491
So it's about that. I know.

881
00:59:56,726 --> 00:59:57,927
Thank you.

882
00:59:57,994 --> 00:59:59,128
However...

883
01:00:00,430 --> 01:00:03,933
Form here, it's politics.

884
01:00:04,901 --> 01:00:07,403
You did well for a doctor,

885
01:00:08,605 --> 01:00:09,772
but it ends here.

886
01:00:10,873 --> 01:00:14,477
I am the Japan
Healthcare Organization Chairman.

887
01:00:14,544 --> 01:00:18,681
The cabinet appoints
and dismisses the chairman.

888
01:00:24,687 --> 01:00:30,326
That's also written in
the bill that's been passed.

889
01:00:37,300 --> 01:00:41,504
This is the cabinet decision
of your dismissal.

890
01:00:41,571 --> 01:00:42,405
YOSHIHITO TENDO, CHAIRMAN

891
01:00:42,472 --> 01:00:43,806
YOSHIHITO TENDO

892
01:00:43,873 --> 01:00:45,908
DISMISSED

893
01:01:00,456 --> 01:01:02,558
Appointing your replacement will be...

894
01:01:05,028 --> 01:01:06,262
Ms. Tokachi.

895
01:01:08,364 --> 01:01:09,399
Yes, sir.

896
01:01:13,469 --> 01:01:16,005
If you can do this on your own...

897
01:01:21,911 --> 01:01:23,246
Then go ahead.

898
01:01:27,650 --> 01:01:28,618
Goodbye.

899
01:02:07,290 --> 01:02:08,391
Dr. Daimon!

900
01:02:10,693 --> 01:02:12,962
Blood pressure 50. Full transfusion.

901
01:02:14,163 --> 01:02:16,599
Daimon, get it together.

902
01:02:17,433 --> 01:02:19,936
Doctor. Dr. Daimon!

903
01:02:28,644 --> 01:02:30,113
Don't run.

904
01:02:30,179 --> 01:02:32,482
Don't blink. Face it.

905
01:02:34,484 --> 01:02:36,219
Stop the bleeding.

906
01:02:36,886 --> 01:02:39,822
- Where is it?
- Don't look for a point.

907
01:02:41,424 --> 01:02:42,925
Cover the whole area.

908
01:02:44,527 --> 01:02:47,230
Then take a deep breath.

909
01:03:01,811 --> 01:03:04,147
- Give me lots of gauze.
- Yes.

910
01:03:04,213 --> 01:03:05,648
- Take my loupe off.
- Yes.

911
01:03:09,652 --> 01:03:12,421
Calm down. Take a deep breath.

912
01:03:14,490 --> 01:03:16,492
Think of the next move.

913
01:03:16,559 --> 01:03:19,929
Blood pressure 45. Blood loss 6,000.

914
01:03:20,363 --> 01:03:21,364
- Chief...
- Yes.

915
01:03:21,998 --> 01:03:26,736
- I'm sorry, but will you play Akira's CD?
- We don't have time for that.

916
01:03:26,803 --> 01:03:27,904
- Excuse me?
- Do it.

917
01:03:27,970 --> 01:03:29,338
- Get the CD.
- Yes.

918
01:03:37,146 --> 01:03:39,215
ALBELT SAVAROTTI THE BEST OF SAVAROTTI

919
01:03:46,756 --> 01:03:48,457
Blood pressure below 40.

920
01:03:50,059 --> 01:03:51,460
Blood loss 7,000.

921
01:03:52,728 --> 01:03:54,030
The bleeding point...

922
01:03:56,232 --> 01:04:00,870
It's the lung cancer's infiltration part.
Clamp the ascending aorta.

923
01:04:02,205 --> 01:04:04,040
Replace the whole aortic arch.

924
01:04:06,909 --> 01:04:09,278
- Get a vascular graft.
- Yes.

925
01:04:09,345 --> 01:04:11,147
- Vascular graft.
- Yes.

926
01:04:11,614 --> 01:04:13,216
- Prepare cardiopulmonary bypass.
- Where is it?

927
01:04:13,282 --> 01:04:14,884
Right atrium and femoral artery.

928
01:04:14,951 --> 01:04:16,185
Blood pressure...

929
01:04:16,252 --> 01:04:18,020
- Raise it.
- I can't.

930
01:04:18,087 --> 01:04:19,989
Just raise it!

931
01:04:26,529 --> 01:04:29,232
Blood pressure up to 50.

932
01:04:31,167 --> 01:04:34,971
Don't worry. It's OK, Akira.

933
01:04:37,273 --> 01:04:40,142
Blood pressure back to 65.

934
01:04:42,678 --> 01:04:43,579
Here I go, Akira.

935
01:04:45,848 --> 01:04:47,250
Clamp ascending aorta.

936
01:04:49,418 --> 01:04:50,553
Hemostat.

937
01:04:51,921 --> 01:04:52,889
Please.

938
01:04:59,896 --> 01:05:02,531
Michiko, don't fail.

939
01:05:05,668 --> 01:05:09,605
Don't worry. I don't fail.

940
01:05:16,012 --> 01:05:17,079
- Scalpel.
- Yes.

941
01:05:41,203 --> 01:05:43,639
Please pack my stuff.

942
01:05:44,040 --> 01:05:44,941
Yes.

943
01:05:50,146 --> 01:05:51,681
Hold on.

944
01:05:52,014 --> 01:05:53,115
I'm sorry.

945
01:05:53,849 --> 01:05:56,185
Someone opened the surgery room.

946
01:05:56,252 --> 01:05:58,487
Mr. Tendo, no, Chairman.

947
01:05:58,554 --> 01:05:59,422
I'm sorry...

948
01:06:34,390 --> 01:06:36,292
Michiko Daimon.

949
01:07:05,121 --> 01:07:06,589
As a doctor,

950
01:07:08,691 --> 01:07:11,360
I should've stayed by the patient.

951
01:07:12,962 --> 01:07:13,963
Mr. Tendo!

952
01:07:17,666 --> 01:07:18,601
Thank you.

953
01:07:18,934 --> 01:07:20,002
Thank you.

954
01:07:21,337 --> 01:07:25,174
In our field of medicine,
there are many paths.

955
01:07:26,308 --> 01:07:28,377
Please fulfill your duty

956
01:07:29,078 --> 01:07:31,947
as a doctor in your own paths.

957
01:07:33,182 --> 01:07:37,253
I will return to being a regular surgeon.

958
01:07:38,788 --> 01:07:41,057
Change and challenge.

959
01:07:47,063 --> 01:07:47,963
Thank you.

960
01:07:54,670 --> 01:07:55,538
Yes, sir!

961
01:08:15,391 --> 01:08:19,728
Repeat basics like how the river flows,

962
01:08:20,262 --> 01:08:22,431
and perform a beautiful operation.

963
01:08:23,232 --> 01:08:25,634
That is my ideal surgery.

964
01:08:31,006 --> 01:08:33,909
And the most important thing...

965
01:08:34,810 --> 01:08:36,579
No matter how hard it is,

966
01:08:37,313 --> 01:08:39,014
don't give up on the patient.

967
01:08:47,156 --> 01:08:48,991
Aortic arch done.

968
01:08:49,058 --> 01:08:50,292
Connect vascular graft.

969
01:08:50,359 --> 01:08:51,193
Yes.

970
01:08:57,800 --> 01:08:59,101
- 4-0 nylon.
- Yes.

971
01:10:27,489 --> 01:10:29,925
<i>Michiko, still playing around?</i>

972
01:10:29,992 --> 01:10:31,293
Come back.

973
01:10:31,360 --> 01:10:35,331
You must be stupid, using all the money

974
01:10:35,397 --> 01:10:38,133
I hid in the locker to go to outer space.

975
01:10:38,200 --> 01:10:43,439
I might be called to operate
on a spaceship one day.

976
01:10:44,073 --> 01:10:50,012
I'm training for that.

977
01:10:50,079 --> 01:10:55,017
It feels so good.

978
01:10:55,351 --> 01:10:59,989
You should've come too, Akira.

979
01:11:00,055 --> 01:11:01,423
Hooray!

980
01:11:01,490 --> 01:11:04,026
Enough of that.

981
01:11:04,093 --> 01:11:07,563
I think Ben Casey's sick.

982
01:11:07,630 --> 01:11:08,664
Hurry back!

983
01:11:08,731 --> 01:11:11,367
Alright, I'll come back.

984
01:11:11,433 --> 01:11:14,370
Don't fail for the landing.

985
01:11:14,436 --> 01:11:15,871
Don't worry.

986
01:11:16,472 --> 01:11:19,708
I don't fail.

987
01:11:20,643 --> 01:11:24,213
<i>She hates groups,</i>
<i>authority, and being controlled.</i>

988
01:11:24,546 --> 01:11:28,917
<i>Her medical license</i>
<i>and experience are her only weapons.</i>

989
01:11:29,418 --> 01:11:31,687
<i>Surgeon Michiko Daimon,</i>

990
01:11:32,154 --> 01:11:34,823
<i>also known as Doctor-X.</i>
